style and take on increasingly challenging foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325200/extras/5c10ad8fb899ae32fe6511b72e51e047.avif?t=1767524651\" width=408 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325200/extras/a8d53fea919241181c96d259d6139832.poster.avif?t=1767524651\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325200/extras/a8d53fea919241181c96d259d6139832.webm?t=1767524651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325200/extras/a8d53fea919241181c96d259d6139832.mp4?t=1767524651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the sinister depths of the toy chest, where forgotten toys  create a world full of mystery. Each area offers unique challenges, hidden secrets, and an atmosphere that grows darker and more threatening as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325200/extras/8a12cd0dc356f2a056912c8d59c30ea5.avif?t=1767524651\" width=556 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rediscover each level in Nightmare Mode, where the difficulty ramps up and the atmosphere takes on an even darker, more ominous tone. Conquer this mode to unlock new abilities, challenges, and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to brave the toy chest and face the darkness within? Grab your hammer, take a deep breath, and prepare to dash and bounce in Teddy Knight!</strong></p>","developers":[